('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:4:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','transliteration','Al ken nodeh lishmo unehalelo b''finu','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:5:he','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','he','אָמַֽרְנוּ וְעָנִֽינוּ אֵין קָדוֹשׁ כַּיהֹוָה׃','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:5:en','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','en','saying and chanting: There is nothing so holy as Adonoy.','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:5:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','transliteration','Amarenu ve aninu ein kadosh ka''adonai','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:6:he','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','he','צוּר מִשֶּׁלּוֹ אָכַֽלְנוּ בָּרְכוּ אֱמוּנַי שָׂבַֽעְנוּ וְהוֹתַֽרְנוּ כִּדְבַר יְהֹוָה׃','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:6:en','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','en','The Rock—from His [store] we have eaten—Bless [Him] my faithful ones. We have satisfied ourselves and we have left over [some food] according to the word of Adonoy.','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:6:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','transliteration','Tzur mishelo achalenu barechu emunai savaenu ve hotarenu kidvar Adonai','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:7:he','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','he','בְּשִׁיר וְקוֹל תּוֹדָה נְבָרֵךְ לֵאלֹהֵֽינוּ','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:7:en','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','en','With song and sound of thanksgiving we will bless our God,','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:7:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','transliteration','B''shir ve kol toda nevarech leloheinu','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:8:he','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','he','עַל אֶֽרֶץ חֶמְדָּה טוֹבָה שֶׁהִנְחִיל לַאֲבוֹתֵֽינוּ','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:8:en','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','en','for the land so desirably good that He parceled out as a heritage to our fathers.','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:8:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','transliteration','Al eretz chemda tova shehinchil la''avoteinu','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:9:he','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','he','מָזוֹן וְצֵדָה הִשְׂבִּֽיעַ לְנַפְשֵֽׁנוּ','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:9:en','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','en','[With] food and sustenance He satisfied our souls;','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:9:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','transliteration','Mazon ve tzeda hisbia lenafshenu','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:10:he','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','he','חַסְדּוֹ גָּבַר עָלֵֽינוּ וֶאֱמֶת יְהֹוָה׃','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:10:en','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','en','His kindliness overwhelmed us and Adonoy is truth.','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:10:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','transliteration','Chasdo gavar aleinu ve''emet Adonai','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:11:he','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','he','צוּר מִשֶּׁלּוֹ אָכַֽלְנוּ בָּרְכוּ אֱמוּנַי שָׂבַֽעְנוּ וְהוֹתַֽרְנוּ כִּדְבַר יְהֹוָה׃','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:11:en','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','en','The Rock—from His [store] we have eaten—Bless [Him] my faithful ones. We have satisfied ourselves and we have left over [some food] according to the word of Adonoy.','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:11:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','transliteration','Tzur mishelo achalenu barechu emunai savaenu ve hotarenu kidvar Adonai','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:12:he','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','he','רַחֵם בְּחַסְדֶּֽךָ עַל עַמְּךָ צוּרֵֽנוּ','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:12:en','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','en','Be compassionate with Your kindliness upon Your people; our Rock,','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:12:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','transliteration','Rachem b''chasdecha al amecha tzurenu','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:13:he','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','he','עַל צִיּוֹן מִשְׁכַּן כְּבוֹדֶֽךָ זְבוּל בֵּית תִּפְאַרְתֵּֽנוּ','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:13:en','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','en','upon Zion, the dwelling-place of Your Glory, the Abode, home of our splendors.','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:13:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','transliteration','Al tziyon mishkan k''vodecha zevul beit tifartenu','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:14:he','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','he','בֶּן־דָּוִד עַבְדֶּֽךָ יָבֹא וְיִגְאָלֵֽנוּ','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:14:en','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','en','May the son of David, Your servant, come and redeem us','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:14:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','transliteration','Ben David avdecha yavo ve yigalenu','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:15:he','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','he','רֽוּחַ אַפֵּֽינוּ מְשִֽׁיחַ יְהֹוָה׃','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:15:en','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','en','the breath of our life—the anointed of Adonoy.','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:15:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','transliteration','Ruach apeinu meshiach Adonai','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:16:he','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','he','צוּר מִשֶּׁלּוֹ אָכַֽלְנוּ בָּרְכוּ אֱמוּנַי שָׂבַֽעְנוּ וְהוֹתַֽרְנוּ כִּדְבַר יְהֹוָה׃','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
