('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:16:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','transliteration','Tzur mishelo achalenu barechu emunai savaenu ve hotarenu kidvar Adonai','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
('sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo:17:he','sefaria-siddur-ashkenaz-shabbat-shabbat-evening-zemirot-for-shabbat-evening-tzur-mishelo','he','יִבָּנֶה הַמִּקְדָּשׁ עִיר צִיּוֹן תְּמַלֵּא','Siddur Ashkenaz, Shabbat, Shabbat Evening, Zemirot for Shabbat Evening, Tzur Mishelo'),
