Nakuv ve hutzeti itechem.
Ken hosha na.
K''hoshata sovevei mizbeach.
Omesei arava lehakif mizbeach.
Ken hosha na.
K''hoshata pilei aron k''hufsha.
Tzier peleshet bacharon af ve nosha.
Ken hosha na.
K''hoshata k''hilot bavela shalachta.
Rachum lema''anam shulachta.
Ken hosha na.
K''hoshata shevut shivtei Yaakov.
Tashuv ve tashiv shevut oholei Yaakov ve hoshia na.
K''hoshata shomerei mitzvot ve chochei yeshuot el lemoshaot.
Ve hoshia na.
Ani vaho hoshia na.','Siddur Sefard, Sukkot, First Day & Chol HaMoed'),
('sefaria-siddur-sefard-sukkot-first-day-chol-hamoed:35:he','sefaria-siddur-sefard-sukkot-first-day-chol-hamoed','he','הוֹשִׁיעָה אֶת עַמֶּךָ וּבָרֵךְ אֶת נַחֲלָתֶךָ וּרְעֵם וְנַשְּׂאֵם עַד הָעוֹלָם: וְיִהְיוּ דְּבָרַי אֵלֶּה אֲשֶׁר הִתְחַנַּנְתִּי לִפְנֵי יְהֹוָה קְרוֹבִים אֶל יְהֹוָה אֱלֹהֵינוּ יוֹמָם וָלָיְלָה לַעֲשׂוֹת מִשְׁפַּט עַבְדּוֹ וּמִשְׁפַּט עַמּוֹ יִשְׂרָאֵל דְּבַר יוֹם בְּיוֹמוֹ: לְמַעַן דַּעַת כָּל עַמֵּי הָאָרֶץ כִּי יְהֹוָה הוּא הָאֱלֹהִים אֵין עוֹד:','Siddur Sefard, Sukkot, First Day & Chol HaMoed'),
('sefaria-siddur-sefard-sukkot-first-day-chol-hamoed:35:en','sefaria-siddur-sefard-sukkot-first-day-chol-hamoed','en','Deliver and bless Your people; tend them and sustain them forever (Psalms 28:9). And may these words of mine, which I have offered in supplication before the Lord, be close to the Lord our God day and night, that He may provide for His servant and for His people Israel, according to each day’s needs. In order that all the peoples of the earth may know that the Lord alone is God, there is no other (I Kings 8:59-60).','Siddur Sefard, Sukkot, First Day & Chol HaMoed'),
('sefaria-siddur-sefard-sukkot-first-day-chol-hamoed:35:transliteration','sefaria-siddur-sefard-sukkot-first-day-chol-hamoed','transliteration','Hoshia et amecha uvarech et nachalatecha ure''em ve nase''em ad ha''olam.
Ve yihyu devarai eleh asher hitchananti lifnei Adonai k''rovim el Adonai Eloheinu yomam valayela la''asot mishpat avdo umishpat amo Yisrael devar yom b''yomo.
Lema''an da''at kol amei ha''aretz ki Adonai hu haelohim ein od.','Siddur Sefard, Sukkot, First Day & Chol HaMoed'),
('sefaria-siddur-sefard-sukkot-first-day-chol-hamoed:36:he','sefaria-siddur-sefard-sukkot-first-day-chol-hamoed','he','קדיש שלם, שיר של יום, לדוד, קריאת התורה, אשרי ובא לציון, מוסף, קוה ועלינו:','Siddur Sefard, Sukkot, First Day & Chol HaMoed'),
('sefaria-siddur-sefard-sukkot-first-day-chol-hamoed:36:en','sefaria-siddur-sefard-sukkot-first-day-chol-hamoed','en','Full Kaddish, the Song of the Day, Le''David (Psalms 27), Reading of the Torah, Ashrei, Uva Letzion, the additional prayer, Kaveh and Aleinu.','Siddur Sefard, Sukkot, First Day & Chol HaMoed'),
