('sefaria-pesach-haggadah-nirtzah-chad-gadya:0:he','sefaria-pesach-haggadah-nirtzah-chad-gadya','he','חַד גַּדְיָא, חַד גַּדְיָא דְּזַבִּין אַבָּא בִּתְרֵי זוּזֵי, חַד גַּדְיָא, חַד גַּדְיָא.','Pesach Haggadah, Nirtzah, Chad Gadya'),
('sefaria-pesach-haggadah-nirtzah-chad-gadya:0:en','sefaria-pesach-haggadah-nirtzah-chad-gadya','en','One kid, one kid that my father bought for two zuz, one kid, one kid.','Pesach Haggadah, Nirtzah, Chad Gadya'),
