('sefaria-pesach-haggadah-nirtzah-chad-gadya:1:he','sefaria-pesach-haggadah-nirtzah-chad-gadya','he','וְאָתָא שׁוּנְרָא וְאַָכְלָה לְגַדְיָא, דְּזַבִּין אַבָּא בִּתְרֵי זוּזֵי. חַד גַּדְיָא, חַד גַּדְיָא.','Pesach Haggadah, Nirtzah, Chad Gadya'),
('sefaria-pesach-haggadah-nirtzah-chad-gadya:1:en','sefaria-pesach-haggadah-nirtzah-chad-gadya','en','Then came a cat and ate the kid that my father bought for two zuz, one kid, one kid.','Pesach Haggadah, Nirtzah, Chad Gadya'),
