('sefaria-pesach-haggadah-nirtzah-chad-gadya:3:he','sefaria-pesach-haggadah-nirtzah-chad-gadya','he','וְאָתָא חוּטְרָא והִכָּה לְכַלְבָּא, דְּנָשַׁךְ לְשׁוּנְרָא, דְּאַָכְלָה לְגַדְיָא, דְּזַבִּין אַבָּא בִּתְרֵי זוּזֵי. חַד גַּדְיָא, חַד גַּדְיָא.','Pesach Haggadah, Nirtzah, Chad Gadya'),
('sefaria-pesach-haggadah-nirtzah-chad-gadya:3:en','sefaria-pesach-haggadah-nirtzah-chad-gadya','en','Then came a stick and hit the dog, that bit the cat, that ate the kid that my father bought for two zuz, one kid, one kid.','Pesach Haggadah, Nirtzah, Chad Gadya'),
('sefaria-pesach-haggadah-nirtzah-chad-gadya:3:transliteration','sefaria-pesach-haggadah-nirtzah-chad-gadya','transliteration','Ve atah chutera vhika lechalba,
