('sefaria-machzor-rosh-hashanah-ashkenaz-linear-mincha-for-erev-rosh-hashana-mourner-s-kaddish:1:he','sefaria-machzor-rosh-hashanah-ashkenaz-linear-mincha-for-erev-rosh-hashana-mourner-s-kaddish','he','בְּעָלְמָא דִּי בְרָא','Machzor Rosh Hashanah Ashkenaz Linear, Mincha for Erev Rosh Hashana, Mourner''s Kaddish'),
('sefaria-machzor-rosh-hashanah-ashkenaz-linear-mincha-for-erev-rosh-hashana-mourner-s-kaddish:1:en','sefaria-machzor-rosh-hashanah-ashkenaz-linear-mincha-for-erev-rosh-hashana-mourner-s-kaddish','en','in the world which He created','Machzor Rosh Hashanah Ashkenaz Linear, Mincha for Erev Rosh Hashana, Mourner''s Kaddish'),
