('sefaria-machzor-rosh-hashanah-ashkenaz-linear-mincha-for-erev-rosh-hashana-mourner-s-kaddish:4:he','sefaria-machzor-rosh-hashanah-ashkenaz-linear-mincha-for-erev-rosh-hashana-mourner-s-kaddish','he','בְּחַיֵּיכוֹן וּבְיוֹמֵיכוֹן','Machzor Rosh Hashanah Ashkenaz Linear, Mincha for Erev Rosh Hashana, Mourner''s Kaddish'),
('sefaria-machzor-rosh-hashanah-ashkenaz-linear-mincha-for-erev-rosh-hashana-mourner-s-kaddish:4:en','sefaria-machzor-rosh-hashanah-ashkenaz-linear-mincha-for-erev-rosh-hashana-mourner-s-kaddish','en','in your lifetime and in your days,','Machzor Rosh Hashanah Ashkenaz Linear, Mincha for Erev Rosh Hashana, Mourner''s Kaddish'),
