('sefaria-machzor-rosh-hashanah-ashkenaz-linear-mincha-for-erev-rosh-hashana-mourner-s-kaddish:7:he','sefaria-machzor-rosh-hashanah-ashkenaz-linear-mincha-for-erev-rosh-hashana-mourner-s-kaddish','he','בַּעֲגָלָא וּבִזְמַן קָרִיב','Machzor Rosh Hashanah Ashkenaz Linear, Mincha for Erev Rosh Hashana, Mourner''s Kaddish'),
