('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-first-day-2:1:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-first-day-2','transliteration','Ve lanu boshet hapanim.','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, First Day.2'),
