('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-first-day-2:10:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-first-day-2','en','Not with virtue nor with good deeds','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, First Day.2'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-first-day-2:10:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-first-day-2','transliteration','Lo ve chesed ve lo ve ma''asim','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, First Day.2'),
