('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-first-day-9:186:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-first-day-9','en','nor chastise me with Your rage.','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, First Day.9'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-first-day-9:186:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-first-day-9','transliteration','Ve al bachamatecha teyasereni.','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, First Day.9'),
