('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-second-day-6:2:he','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-second-day-6','he','כִּי דַלּוֹנוּ מְאֹד:','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Second Day.6'),
