('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:19:he','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','he','אַהֲבַת צִיּוֹן אַל תִּשְׁכַּח לָנֶֽצַח:','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:19:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','en','the love of Zion, forget not until eternity.','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:19:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','transliteration','Ahavat tziyon al tishkach lanetzach.','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:20:he','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','he','זְכֹר יְהֹוָה','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:20:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','en','Remember, Adonoy,','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:20:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','transliteration','Zechor Adonai','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
