('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:21:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','en','to the sons of Edom, the day of Jerusalem,','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:21:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','transliteration','Livnei edom et yom yerushalami','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
