('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:22:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','en','[it was they] who said,','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:22:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','transliteration','Haomerim','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
