('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:30:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','en','to whom You swore by Your very Self,','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:30:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','transliteration','Asher nishbaeta lahem bach','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:31:he','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','he','וַתְּדַבֵּר אֲלֵהֶם','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:31:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','en','and You said to them:','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:31:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','transliteration','Vatedaber alehem','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
