('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:34:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','en','and all this land that I have promised,','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:34:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','transliteration','Ve chol ha''aretz hazot asher amareti','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:35:he','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','he','אֶתֵּן לְזַרְעֲכֶם','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:35:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','en','I will give to your descendants,','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:35:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','transliteration','Eten lezarachem','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:36:he','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','he','וְנָחֲלוּ לְעוֹלָם:','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:36:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','en','and they will inherit it forever.”','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:36:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','transliteration','Ve nachalu le''olam.','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:37:he','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','he','זְכֹר לַעֲבָדֶֽיךָ','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:37:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','en','Remember Your servants,','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:37:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','transliteration','Zechor la''avadeicha','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:38:he','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','he','לְאַבְרָהָם לְיִצְחָק וּלְיַעֲקֹב.','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:38:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','en','Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob;','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:38:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','transliteration','LeAvraham leYitzchak uleya''akov.','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:39:he','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','he','אַל תֵּֽפֶן אֶל קְשִׁי הָעָם הַזֶּה','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:39:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','en','do not regard the stubborness of this people,','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:39:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','transliteration','Al tefen el k''shi ha''am hazeh','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
