('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:43:he','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','he','אֲשֶׁר נוֹאַֽלְנוּ וַאֲשֶׁר חָטָֽאנוּ:','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:43:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','en','wherein we have acted foolishly and sinned.','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:43:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','transliteration','Asher noalenu va''asher chatanu.','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:44:he','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','he','חָטָֽאנוּ צוּרֵֽנוּ','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:44:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','en','We have sinned, our Rock;','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:44:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','transliteration','Chatanu tzurenu','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:45:he','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','he','סְלַח לָֽנוּ יוֹצְרֵֽנוּ:','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:45:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','en','pardon us our Creator.','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:45:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','transliteration','Selach lanu yotzerenu.','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:46:he','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','he','זְכוֹר לָֽנוּ בְּרִית אָבוֹת','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:46:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','en','Remember to us the covenant of the Patriarchs,','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6:46:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-sixth-day-6','transliteration','Zechor lanu b''rit avot','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Sixth Day.6'),
