('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6:25:he','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6','he','תְּרַחֵם צִיּוֹן.','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Seventh Day.6'),
