('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6:26:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6','en','for it is time to be gracious to her,','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Seventh Day.6'),
