('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6:28:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6','en','Remember Abraham, Isaac, Israel,','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Seventh Day.6'),
