('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6:30:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6','en','to whom You swore by Your very Self,','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Seventh Day.6'),
