('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6:31:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6','en','and You said to them:','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Seventh Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6:31:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6','transliteration','Vatedaber alehem','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Seventh Day.6'),
