('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6:32:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6','en','“I will multiply your seed','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Seventh Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6:32:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6','transliteration','Arbeh et zarachem','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Seventh Day.6'),
