('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6:40:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6','transliteration','Ve el risho ve el chatato.','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Seventh Day.6'),
