('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6:41:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6','en','Do not, we beseech You','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Seventh Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6:41:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6','transliteration','Al na','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Seventh Day.6'),
