('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6:44:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6','en','We have sinned, our Rock;','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Seventh Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6:44:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6','transliteration','Chatanu tzurenu','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Seventh Day.6'),
