('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6:45:transliteration','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6','transliteration','Selach lanu yotzerenu.','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Seventh Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6:46:he','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6','he','זְכוֹר לָֽנוּ בְּרִית אָבוֹת','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Seventh Day.6'),
