('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6:47:he','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6','he','כַּאֲשֶׁר אָמַֽרְתָּ.','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Seventh Day.6'),
('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6:47:en','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-seventh-day-6','en','as You promised,','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Seventh Day.6'),
