('sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-fourth-day-of-the-ten-days-of-penitence-2:98:he','sefaria-selichot-nusach-lita-linear-fourth-day-of-the-ten-days-of-penitence-2','he','לְךָ יְהֹוָה','Selichot Nusach Lita Linear, Fourth Day of the Ten Days of Penitence.2'),
