('research-habakkuk-3:3:transliteration','research-habakkuk-3','transliteration','Ve nogah kaor tiheyeh karnayim miyado lo ve sham chevyon uzoh','Habakkuk 3'),
('research-habakkuk-3:4:he','research-habakkuk-3','he','לְפָנָ֖יו יֵ֣לֶךְ דָּ֑בֶר וְיֵצֵ֥א רֶ֖שֶׁף לְרַגְלָֽיו׃','Habakkuk 3'),
