('research-habakkuk-3:9:he','research-habakkuk-3','he','רָא֤וּךָ יָחִ֙ילוּ֙ הָרִ֔ים זֶ֥רֶם מַ֖יִם עָבָ֑ר נָתַ֤ן תְּהוֹם֙ קוֹל֔וֹ ר֖וֹם יָדֵ֥יהוּ נָשָֽׂא׃','Habakkuk 3'),
('research-habakkuk-3:9:en','research-habakkuk-3','en','The mountains have seen Thee, and they tremble; the tempest of waters floweth over; the deep uttereth its voice, And lifteth up its hands on high.','Habakkuk 3'),
('research-habakkuk-3:9:transliteration','research-habakkuk-3','transliteration','Raucha yachilu harim zerem mayim avar natan tehom kolo rom yadeihu nasa','Habakkuk 3'),
('research-habakkuk-3:10:he','research-habakkuk-3','he','שֶׁ֥מֶשׁ יָרֵ֖חַ עָ֣מַד זְבֻ֑לָה לְא֤וֹר חִצֶּ֙יךָ֙ יְהַלֵּ֔כוּ לְנֹ֖גַהּ בְּרַ֥ק חֲנִיתֶֽךָ׃','Habakkuk 3'),
('research-habakkuk-3:10:en','research-habakkuk-3','en','The sun and moon stand still in their habitation; at the light of Thine arrows as they go, At the shining of Thy glittering spear.','Habakkuk 3'),
('research-habakkuk-3:10:transliteration','research-habakkuk-3','transliteration','Shemesh yareach amad zevula leor chitzecha yehalechu lenogah b''rak chanitecha','Habakkuk 3'),
